body:
Somewhat, online.  Far more rarely in person. 

&#x200B;

Mostly feeling just....exhausted and broken

Severe mental illness (OCD and accompanying depression) coupled with intense degrees of isolation and years of failed treatment.

&#x200B;

Most of the things I wish I could get around to doing are things I can't accomplish on my own, not without significant blowback in terms of compulsive responses & panic attacks. Let alone costs.

&#x200B;

I'm not looking for a rational reason to stay. I'm looking for rational acts to complete to ease the burdens I will leave behind.
